    <span class="section-label">Service Agreement</span>
    <h1>What we sign to <em>start working together.</em></h1>
    <p>A plain-language reference copy of my service agreement. The version you sign will have your business details and the plan you chose, but the substance is what's here. I publish it because you should be able to read the whole thing before any sales call.</p>
  </div>
